# AI SDLC Overlay

This project uses the AI SDLC overlay from saas-constitution.

- **Version:** `None`
- **Autonomy:** L3-act-with-approval
- **Verification:** `make verify`
- **Language:** mixed
- **Tracking:** team (overlay files committed; ephemeral paths in `.gitignore`)
## Update

Check version: `make sdlc-version`
Check health: `make sdlc-health`
Refresh git ignore rules: `make sdlc-apply-ignore`
Remove git ignore rules: `make sdlc-remove-ignore`
Update: `make sdlc-update` (or `copier update --trust -a .copier-answers.sdlc.yml`)
Preview: `copier update --trust -a .copier-answers.sdlc.yml --pretend`

Changelog: see CHANGELOG.sdlc.md in saas-constitution repo for what changed between versions.

## Session Start Protocol

- Check `.sdlc/KILLSWITCH` — if exists, refuse ALL actions and report
- Read `.sdlc/context/project-overview.md` for project understanding
- Read `.sdlc/context/conventions.md` for coding standards
- Read `.sdlc/learnings/LEARNINGS.jsonl` (last 20 entries) for past lessons
- Read `.sdlc/trust-ledger.json` for current autonomy and trust score

## Quick Reference

- Spec workflow: `.sdlc/specs/` + templates in `.sdlc/templates/`
- Verification: `make verify`
- Autonomy level: L3-act-with-approval
- Kill switch: `make sdlc-killswitch` / `make sdlc-resume`
- Health check: `make sdlc-health`
